Daśaratha bids Sumantra dispatch treasure, army and sages ahead --- Fourfold army follows Daśaratha and sages on road --- Daśaratha reaches Vidēha after four days amid Janaka welcome --- Janaka greets old Daśaratha and hails Vasiṣṭha arrival --- Janaka fixes sage-approved wedding for next morning --- Daśaratha defers to giver and pledges obedience --- Sages, kings and Rāma brothers rest joyfully overnight --- Janaka completes sacrifice and daughters rites for night